# Media editing masters — large source files that are NOT needed at build or
# runtime (the derived, size-optimized assets under apps/web/public/media/
# ARE committed because the app serves them). Keep media-source/README.md
# tracked so the regeneration steps stay in the repo.
apps/web/media-source/*.mp4
apps/web/media-source/*.mov
apps/web/media-source/*.webm
